    'Study the diagram in Figure 2.74 (Ammeters $A_1$ and $A_4$ in the main series branch before and after a parallel junction, and Ammeters $A_2$ and $A_3$ in the two parallel resistor branches): (a) What is the relationship between the ammeter readings on $A_1$ and $A_4$? Explain your answer. (b) What is the relationship between the ammeter readings on $A_1$, $A_2$ and $A_3$? Explain your answer.',
