    'Step 1: The Earth\'s molten metallic outer core acts as a geodynamo. Step 2: Because unlike poles attract, the geomagnetic pole near Geographic North is actually a magnetic South-seeking polarity (so magnetic field lines emerge near Geographic South and enter near Geographic North). Step 3: Used for compass navigation, animal migration, and solar-wind shielding.',
