    'Step 1: (11) A uniform field exerts torque to align a dipole, but zero net translational force ($F_{\\text{net}} = mB - mB = 0$) once aligned. Step 2: (12) Closed head-to-tail N–S loops are stable. Step 3: (13) The T-test uses the fact that a bar magnet has strong poles at its ends and a neutral region at its middle.',
